                    Frequently Asked Questions
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Explore answers to some of the questions our customers
                    commonly ask about our traditional Patola textiles.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================================
                 FAQ LIST
            ================================================== -->

            <div class="faq-list">


                <!-- =================================================
                     FAQ 1
                ================================================== -->

                <div class="faq-item">

                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="faq-question"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="faq-answer-1"
                    >

                        <span>
                            Are your Patola sarees handcrafted?
                        </span>

                        <span
                            class="faq-icon"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            +
                        </span>

                    </button>


                    <div
                        class="faq-answer"
                        id="faq-answer-1"
                        hidden
                    >

                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">

                            <p>
                                Patola is a traditional textile art known for
                                its intricate resist-dyeing and weaving
                                techniques. Our collection celebrates this
                                heritage and the skilled craftsmanship behind
                                traditional Patola textiles.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- =================================================
                     FAQ 2
                ================================================== -->

                <div class="faq-item">

                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="faq-question"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="faq-answer-2"
                    >

                        <span>
                            How should I care for my Patola saree?
                        </span>

                        <span
                            class="faq-icon"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            +
                        </span>

                    </button>


                    <div
                        class="faq-answer"
                        id="faq-answer-2"
                        hidden
                    >

                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">

                            <p>
                                Traditional Patola textiles should be handled
                                with care. Follow the care instructions
                                provided with your saree and avoid harsh
                                washing methods. When in doubt, professional
                                cleaning suitable for the fabric is the safer
                                choice.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- =================================================
                     FAQ 3
                ================================================== -->

                <div class="faq-item">

                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="faq-question"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="faq-answer-3"
                    >

                        <span>
                            How long does delivery take?
                        </span>

                        <span
                            class="faq-icon"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            +
                        </span>

                    </button>


                    <div
                        class="faq-answer"
                        id="faq-answer-3"
                        hidden
                    >

                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">

                            <p>
                                Delivery time can vary depending on the
                                product, availability and delivery location.
                                Please contact Yogita Patola Art before placing
                                an order if you need an estimated delivery
                                timeline for a specific piece.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- =================================================
                     FAQ 4
                ================================================== -->

                <div class="faq-item">

                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="faq-question"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="faq-answer-4"
                    >

                        <span>
                            Do you provide customization?
                        </span>

                        <span
                            class="faq-icon"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            +
                        </span>

                    </button>


                    <div
                        class="faq-answer"
                        id="faq-answer-4"
                        hidden
                    >

                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">

                            <p>
                                Customization may depend on the particular
                                product and weaving requirements. Please
                                contact us with your requirements so we can
                                confirm whether the requested customization
                                is possible.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- =================================================
                     FAQ 5
                ================================================== -->

                <div class="faq-item">

                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="faq-question"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="faq-answer-5"
                    >

                        <span>
                            What is the difference between Single Ikat and
                            Double Ikat?
                        </span>

                        <span
                            class="faq-icon"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                            +
                        </span>

                    </button>


                    <div
                        class="faq-answer"
                        id="faq-answer-5"
                        hidden
                    >

                        <div class="faq-answer-inner">

                            <p>
                                In Single Ikat, the pattern is created by
                                resist-dyeing either the warp or the weft
                                before weaving. In Double Ikat, both the warp
                                and weft are resist-dyed and carefully aligned
                                during weaving. Double Ikat therefore requires
                                particularly precise planning and weaving
                                skill.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- =================================================
                     FAQ 6
                ================================================== -->

                <div class="faq-item">

                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="faq-question"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="faq-answer-6"
                    >

